{% comment %}
CARBON size-guide router.
Create a single-line product metafield: custom.jeans_size_guide_fit
Allowed values: slim, skinny, super-skinny-long, super-skinny-zipper
{% endcomment %}
{% assign carbon_fit = product.metafields.custom.jeans_size_guide_fit.value | default: product.metafields.custom.jeans_size_guide_fit %}
{%- comment -%}
  The size-guide popup is the one modal in this theme that needs to be wide.

  The theme gives every product popup the same 800px shell. Inside it the three
  measurement photos render at 184x138 — too small to show a shopper where the
  tape goes, which is the entire point of them.

  :has() scopes this to a modal that actually contains a Carbon size guide, so
  no other popup in the theme is touched, and a browser without :has() simply
  keeps the theme's own width rather than breaking.
{%- endcomment -%}
<style>
  .product-popup-modal__content:has([id^="carbon-size-guide-"]) {
    width: min(1160px, calc(100vw - 48px));
    max-width: none;
  }
  /* The guide names itself. The theme's "Size Guide" bar above it repeats that
     and costs 73px of the first screen, so the heading is dropped and the row
     kept — the close button lives in it. */
  .product-popup-modal__content:has([id^="carbon-size-guide-"]) .product-popup-modal__content-header {
    justify-content: flex-end;
    border-bottom: 0;
    /* The theme sets an explicit height: 73px here. With the heading hidden that
       is mostly empty space above the guide's own title, so the height is
       released — but the row must still CONTAIN the 30px close button. Shrinking
       it further let the button overhang into the scroll area, which then
       intercepted the click and made the modal impossible to close. */
    height: auto;
    padding: 9px 14px 7px;
    min-height: 0;
    /* The header is sticky but the scrolling pane below it paints on top, so
       once the row is short enough to sit beside that pane the close button
       stops receiving clicks. A stacking order puts it back in front. */
    position: sticky;
    top: 0;
    z-index: 5;
  }
  .product-popup-modal__content:has([id^="carbon-size-guide-"]) .product-popup-modal__content-header h5 {
    display: none;
  }
  @media (max-width: 749px) {
    .product-popup-modal__content:has([id^="carbon-size-guide-"]) {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 100%;
    }
  }
</style>
{% case carbon_fit %}
  {% when 'slim' %}{% render 'carbon-size-guide-slim' %}
  {% when 'skinny' %}{% render 'carbon-size-guide-skinny' %}
  {% when 'super-skinny-long' %}{% render 'carbon-size-guide-super-skinny-long' %}
  {% when 'super-skinny-zipper' %}{% render 'carbon-size-guide-super-skinny-zipper' %}
{% endcase %}
